{"status":"ready","content":"I'll compute 987654321² systematically.\n\n## Setting Up the Calculation\n\nLet me write 987654321 = 1,000,000,000 - 12,345,679\n\nWait, let me verify: 1,000,000,000 - 987,654,321 = 12,345,679 ✓\n\n## Using (a - b)² = a² - 2ab + b²\n\nWhere a = 10⁹ and b = 12,345,679\n\n**a²** = 10¹⁸ = 1,000,000,000,000,000,000\n\n**2ab** = 2 × 10⁹ × 12,345,679 = 24,691,358 × 10⁹ = 24,691,358,000,000,000\n\n**b²** = 12,345,679²\n\n### Computing 12,345,679²\n\n12,345,679 = 12,000,000 + 345,679\n\n- (12,000,000)² = 144,000,000,000,000\n- 2 × 12,000,000 × 345,679 = 24 × 345,679 × 10⁶ = 8,296,296 × 10⁶ = 8,296,296,000,000\n- (345,679)² = ?\n\n345,679² : (345,000 + 679)²\n- 345,000² = 119,025,000,000\n- 2 × 345,000 × 679 = 468,510,000\n- 679² = 461,041\n- Sum: 119,025,000,000 + 468,510,000 + 461,041 = **119,493,971,041**\n\nSo b² = 144,000,000,000,000 + 8,296,296,000,000 + 119,493,971,041\n= **152,415,789,971,041**\n\n## Final Assembly\n\n$$a^2 - 2ab + b^2$$\n\n```\n  1,000,000,000,000,000,000\n-        24,691,358,000,000,000\n+           152,415,789,971,041\n```\n\nStep 1: 1,000,000,000,000,000,000 - 24,691,358,000,000,000 = **975,308,642,000,000,000**\n\nStep 2: 975,308,642,000,000,000 + 152,415,789,971,041 = **975,461,057,789,971,041**\n\n## Result\n\n$$987{,}654{,}321^2 = \\boxed{975{,}461{,}057{,}789{,}971{,}041}$$\n","metadata":{"modelLabel":"Claude Sonnet 4.6","modelId":"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6","promptId":"31-own-Large-Square","content":"I'll compute 987654321² systematically.\n\n## Setting Up the Calculation\n\nLet me write 987654321 = 1,000,000,000 - 12,345,679\n\nWait, let me verify: 1,000,000,000 - 987,654,321 = 12,345,679 ✓\n\n## Using (a - b)² = a² - 2ab + b²\n\nWhere a = 10⁹ and b = 12,345,679\n\n**a²** = 10¹⁸ = 1,000,000,000,000,000,000\n\n**2ab** = 2 × 10⁹ × 12,345,679 = 24,691,358 × 10⁹ = 24,691,358,000,000,000\n\n**b²** = 12,345,679²\n\n### Computing 12,345,679²\n\n12,345,679 = 12,000,000 + 345,679\n\n- (12,000,000)² = 144,000,000,000,000\n- 2 × 12,000,000 × 345,679 = 24 × 345,679 × 10⁶ = 8,296,296 × 10⁶ = 8,296,296,000,000\n- (345,679)² = ?\n\n345,679² : (345,000 + 679)²\n- 345,000² = 119,025,000,000\n- 2 × 345,000 × 679 = 468,510,000\n- 679² = 461,041\n- Sum: 119,025,000,000 + 468,510,000 + 461,041 = **119,493,971,041**\n\nSo b² = 144,000,000,000,000 + 8,296,296,000,000 + 119,493,971,041\n= **152,415,789,971,041**\n\n## Final Assembly\n\n$$a^2 - 2ab + b^2$$\n\n```\n  1,000,000,000,000,000,000\n-        24,691,358,000,000,000\n+           152,415,789,971,041\n```\n\nStep 1: 1,000,000,000,000,000,000 - 24,691,358,000,000,000 = **975,308,642,000,000,000**\n\nStep 2: 975,308,642,000,000,000 + 152,415,789,971,041 = **975,461,057,789,971,041**\n\n## Result\n\n$$987{,}654{,}321^2 = \\boxed{975{,}461{,}057{,}789{,}971{,}041}$$\n","inferredMetadata":{"inferred":true,"sourcePath":"scripts/responses/claude-sonnet-4-6/31-own-Large-Square.json","modelSlug":"claude-sonnet-4-6","modelFamily":"claude_mid_tier","modelReleaseDate":"Feb 2026","modelSource":"openrouter"},"prompt":{"id":"31-own-Large-Square","text":"Compute 987654321 squared exactly.","tags":["reasoning","math"]}},"path":"responses/claude-sonnet-4-6/31-own-Large-Square.json","size":1952,"mtime":1779394302}